      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/climbing_hill_iowa"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Climbing Hill is situated within the Loess Hills, a unique landscape formed by wind-deposited silt during the last Ice Age.",
